similar_to:             [E535]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

# ═══ 元数据 ═══
doc_file:               doc/E605.md
last_updated: 2026-09-25
source_event:           librest/0.10.2 platform CI #60616 exposed GDummyTlsBackend for Flickr; CI #60629 then exposed custom-serialize's raw-thread/fixed-port startup race. After both upstream paths passed, CI #60642 failed the packaged consumer with missing libjson-glib. CI #60661 printed json-glib's directory in the explicit transitive path yet failed identically, proving that directory enumeration alone is insufficient on this native loader. The successor materializes 55 shared-library names into one loader-first directory and re-signs critical copied roots; local cross Conan r103 returned RC 0, while native platform execution remains authoritative.

